        "TileImage": "$($repository eceef7f6-d43d-4435-a088-0c686cf202dc).Image",
        "Description": "Our previous client has unveiled yet another competitor&apos;s illicit activities. This time, the Helen West&apos;s baked goods have been found to contain unconventional ingredients, likely from an underground assassination ring she helps facilitate. For obvious reasons, both our client and the ICA would like the competition taken off of the market. What&apos;s more, the client has again asked us to send a message to any would be accomplices. Think you can rise to the occasion, 47?",
